# Cloud API key for OpenAI-compatible providers (OpenRouter, OpenAI, ...).
#
# To use cloud LLMs:
#   1. Copy this file to config/secrets.cfg  (which is gitignored)
#   2. Paste your key below
#   3. Set provider/base_url/model in config/llm.cfg
#
# Alternatively, skip this file and export the key as the environment variable
# named by api_key_env in llm.cfg (default OPENROUTER_API_KEY) — the env var
# wins when both are present. NEVER commit a real key.

api_key = sk-or-...your-openrouter-key...
